From: builder <builder@localhost>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:25:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 05/20] AGS-W09: drop the vendor hidl base/manager stubs (clash
 with Q's android.hidl.base@1.0)

---
 libhidl/Android.mk | 30 ------------------------------
 product/hidl.mk    |  5 +++--
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 libhidl/Android.mk

diff --git a/libhidl/Android.mk b/libhidl/Android.mk
deleted file mode 100644
index 1c521e1..0000000
--- a/libhidl/Android.mk
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,30 +0,0 @@
-#
